T1  - Enhanced graph neural network for rapid multi-field seismic prediction in shield tunnels with contact loss defects
AU  - Wu, Xianlong
AU  - Shen, Jun
AU  - Bao, Xiaohua
AU  - Chen, Xiangsheng
